<section class="zk-document-hero"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="zk-eyebrow">ZKTeco WFM · LEGAL &amp; PRIVACY</div><h1>Privacy Notice</h1><p>ZK Technology LLC dba ZKTeco WFM</p><p class="zk-document-date">Last Updated: September 23, 2026</p></div></section>
